 676+ 7FC3 B7               OR A
 677+ 7FC4 C8               RET Z
 678+ 7FC5 3D               DEC A
 679+ 7FC6 32 86 7F         LD (BellVolR), A
 680+ 7FC9 5F               LD E, A
 681+ 7FCA 3E 0A            LD A, 10
