  35+ 8DA1 0F               RRCA
  36+ 8DA2 0F               RRCA
  37+ 8DA3 0F               RRCA
  38+ 8DA4 E6 1F            AND $1F
  39+ 8DA6 32 B9 97         LD (MaiFlowPlCx), A
