  49+ 8DB6                  ; --- Swap a stack temporal (bank 2) ---
  50+ 8DB6 ED 73 C0 97      LD (MaiFlowSavedSP), SP
  51+ 8DBA 31 60 98         LD SP, MaiTempStackTop
  52+ 8DBD
  53+ 8DBD                  ; --- Ventana de paginacion ---
  54+ 8DBD                  ; IFF tracking via StartupComplete (RAM) - evita race del LD A,I
  55+ 8DBD F3               DI
  56+ 8DBE 3A 8A 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
  57+ 8DC1 E6 F8            AND $F8
  58+ 8DC3 F6 06            OR 6
