1578+ 9542 21 98 8D         LD HL, MonsterExitCoord
1579+ 9545 19               ADD HL, DE
1580+ 9546 7E               LD A, (HL)
1581+ 9547 32 C4 97         LD (MaiGapCoord), A
1582+ 954A CD 31 90         CALL MaiPickRandomGap.mprgTranslate ; Escribe MaiSpawnX/Y
1583+ 954D
1584+ 954D                  ; --- Reach: bbox del monster (16w × 21h) overlapea con el pixel del gap.
1585+ 954D                  ; Tolerancia segun side (para no sobre-permitir despawn lejos del gap):
1586+ 954D                  ;   N/S (sides 0,1) - gaps son 4 chars de ancho:
1587+ 954D                  ;     X paralelo = 47 px (bbox 16 + gap 32 - 1)
1588+ 954D                  ;     Y perpendicular = 28 px (bbox 21 + gap 8 - 1)
1589+ 954D                  ;   W/E (sides 2,3) - gaps duales: 3 chars superior, 5 chars inferior:
1590+ 954D                  ;     X perpendicular = 23 px (bbox 16 + gap 8 - 1)
1591+ 954D                  ;     Y paralelo = 60 px (bbox 21 + gap 40 - 1, cubre 5 chars worst-case)
1592+ 954D 3A C3 97         LD A, (MaiGapSide)
1593+ 9550 FE 02            CP 2                                        ; MAI_SIDE_W = 2
1594+ 9552 30 1E            JR NC, .mulReachVerticalSide                ; W/E
1595+ 9554
1596+ 9554                  ; --- N/S: X paralelo 47, Y perpendicular 28 ---
1597+ 9554 3A C8 97         LD A, (MaiSpawnX)
1598+ 9557 47               LD B, A
1599+ 9558 DD 7E 03         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSX)
1600+ 955B 90               SUB B
1601+ 955C C6 17            ADD A, 23
1602+ 955E FE 2F            CP 47
1603+ 9560 30 32            JR NC, .mulNotReached
1604+ 9562 3A C9 97         LD A, (MaiSpawnY)
1605+ 9565 47               LD B, A
1606+ 9566 DD 7E 04         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSY)
1607+ 9569 90               SUB B
