1908+ A984                  ; Prioridad: E/W sobre N/S
1909+ A984 CB 57            BIT 2, A
1910+ A986 20 0C            JR NZ, .runE
1911+ A988 CB 5F            BIT 3, A
1912+ A98A 20 10            JR NZ, .runW
1913+ A98C CB 47            BIT 0, A
1914+ A98E 20 14            JR NZ, .runN
1915+ A990 16 0E            LD D, SPRID_WALK_S
1916+ A992 18 12            JR .runSet
1917+ A994              .runE:
1918+ A994 16 02            LD D, SPRID_WALK_E
1919+ A996 1E 04            LD E, 4
1920+ A998 0E 02            LD C, ANIM_DELAY_RUN
1921+ A99A 18 0E            JR .applyAnim
