3658+ B357 38 07            JR C, .moCpYCheck2
3659+ B359 5F               LD E, A
3660+ B35A DD 7E 04         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSY)
3661+ B35D BB               CP E
3662+ B35E 30 0E            JR NC, .moCpOk                      ; monY >= playerY + 21 → no overlap
3663+ B360              .moCpYCheck2:
