4835+ B9A5 3E 01            LD A, 1
4836+ B9A7 32 B8 B9         LD (.spawnIgnoreZone), A
4837+ B9AA 3E 04            LD A, 4
4838+ B9AC 32 B7 B9         LD (.spawnTries), A
4839+ B9AF C3 6C B8         JP .spawnRetry
