1226+ D3B6              .roaAabbLoop:
1227+ D3B6                  ; (HL+0)=pX, (HL+1)=pY, (HL+2)=pXEnd, (HL+3)=pYEnd.
1228+ D3B6                  ; eraseRect = [eX..eX+3] × [eY..eY+3].
1229+ D3B6                  ; Overlap: pX <= eX+3 AND pXEnd >= eX AND pY <= eY+3 AND pYEnd >= eY.
