 246+ E4FD              ; --- DrawSwordModeHUD: pinta letra B/C/A en fila 23, col 0 ---
 247+ E4FD              DrawSwordModeHUD:
 248+ E4FD 3A 88 B3         LD A, (SwordMode)
 249+ E500 21 30 E5         LD HL, .modeChars
 250+ E503 5F               LD E, A
