 228+ EC70 38 05            JR C, .minOk
 229+ EC72 D6 05            SUB 5
 230+ EC74 04               INC B
 231+ EC75 18 F7            JR .divMin
 232+ EC77              .minOk:
 233+ EC77 78               LD A, B
 234+ EC78 21 6A EA         LD HL, MinHandPtrs
 235+ EC7B CD 68 EE         CALL DrawHandLine
