1247+ F4C2 CD 0D 64         CALL ApplyChurchTrapDone
1248+ F4C5 AF               XOR A
1249+ F4C6 32 CE 82         LD (ChurchCutscenePhase), A
1250+ F4C9 32 9D 5F         LD (ChurchCutsceneFrame), A
1251+ F4CC C9               RET
