1370+ F56C 3E 01            LD A, 1
1371+ F56E CD 27 65         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; draw smoke[1]
1372+ F571 18 1E            JR .ucsSmokeIncFrame
1373+ F573              .ucsSmokeStep2:
1374+ F573 3E 01            LD A, 1
1375+ F575 CD 27 65         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; erase smoke[1]
1376+ F578 3E 02            LD A, 2
1377+ F57A CD 27 65         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; draw smoke[2]
1378+ F57D 18 12            JR .ucsSmokeIncFrame
1379+ F57F              .ucsSmokeEnd:
1380+ F57F 3E 02            LD A, 2
1381+ F581 CD 27 65         CALL DrawSmokeFrameXor                  ; erase smoke[2]
1382+ F584 CD 46 65         CALL ClearSmokeAttrs                    ; 2x2 chars -> paper/ink black
1383+ F587 3E 04            LD A, 4
1384+ F589 32 CE 82         LD (ChurchCutscenePhase), A
1385+ F58C AF               XOR A
1386+ F58D 32 9D 5F         LD (ChurchCutsceneFrame), A
1387+ F590 C9               RET
