2016+ F96B 0F             RRCA
2016+ F96C 0F             RRCA                  ; /8
2017+ F96D E6 1F            AND $1F
2018+ F96F 57               LD D, A                             ; height_chars
2019+ F970 1E 02            LD E, 2                             ; width_chars (siempre 2 para flechas)
