2075+ F9AF 97 F6            DEFW BgGfx_arrow_2x2_south          ; 1 = S (id 49)
2076+ F9B1 0A F6            DEFW BgGfx_arrow_2x2_west           ; 2 = W (id 80)
2077+ F9B3 C0 F6            DEFW BgGfx_arrow_2x2_east           ; 3 = E (id 82)
