1063+ E210              ; ==============================================================================
1064+ E210              ; Player redraw helpers — REUSADOS de town_gate_cutscene.asm (slot 1, always-vis):
1065+ E210              ;   TownGateRedrawPlayer:    erase old + draw new (cambio sprite/posicion).
1066+ E210              ;   TownGateDrawPlayerHere:  draw + attrs en (ENT_DRAWX, PlayerDrawY).
1067+ E210              ;   TownGateErasePlayer:     XOR-erase en (ENT_OLDX, ENT_OLDY) + RestoreOldAttr.
