 451+ E77C              ; ---- Phase 8: 1 frame de gap tras arm erase ----
 452+ E77C              .tgPhArmOut:
 453+ E77C CD 28 E8         CALL TownGateDecTimer
 454+ E77F C0               RET NZ
 455+ E780                  ; Player gira a IDLE (mirando jugador, sprite al sur)
 456+ E780 DD 21 A3 81      LD IX, EntityTable
 457+ E784 3E 00            LD A, SPRID_IDLE
