 379+ EBED                  ; --- Sin buffs. Prioridad 3: cooldown de espada = MAGENTA bright ---
 380+ EBED 3A 85 B3         LD A, (AttackCooldown)
 381+ EBF0 B7               OR A
 382+ EBF1 28 06            JR Z, .upcc_default
 383+ EBF3 3E 43            LD A, MAGENTA | $40                     ; $43 magenta bright (cooldown)
 384+ EBF5 32 A8 81         LD (EntityTable + ENT_ATTR), A
