1296+ F061 FE 06            CP ROLLED_ROULETTE
1296+ F063 28 3A          JR Z, .crsApplyRouletteHit
1297+ F065 FE 01            CP ROLLED_LIFE
1297+ F067 CA 6F EA       JP Z, GiveLifeBody
1298+ F06A FE 02            CP ROLLED_HEALTH
1298+ F06C CA 7A EA       JP Z, GiveHealthBody
1299+ F06F FE 03            CP ROLLED_STAMINA
1299+ F071 CA 8B EA       JP Z, GiveStaminaBody
1300+ F074 FE 04            CP ROLLED_RAYO
1300+ F076 CA 80 EC       JP Z, ApplyRayoBuff
1301+ F079 FE 05            CP ROLLED_CARACOL
1301+ F07B CA F3 EC       JP Z, ApplyCaracolBuff
1302+ F07E FE 08            CP ROLLED_COMPASS
1302+ F080 CA 67 6C       JP Z, ApplyMagicCompassBuff_B7
1303+ F083 FE 07            CP ROLLED_MUSHROOM
1303+ F085 CA 96 EC       JP Z, ApplyMushroomBuff
